# Full-volume known-free placement candidate query over one snapshot lease.
# One request names exactly one box size; yaw_mode selects yaw 0, yaw 90, or
# both. The response pages the FEASIBLE candidates of the deterministic
# (yaw, cx, cy, cz) ascending enumeration; identity is the snapshot the page
# was computed against, so pages from different revisions never mix.
string handle
float64 box_length
float64 box_width
float64 box_height
uint8 yaw_mode
uint64 cursor
uint32 limit
---
string status
uld_occ_observer/SnapshotIdentity identity
int64 age_ns
uint64 next_cursor
bool done
int32[] cell_x
int32[] cell_y
int32[] cell_z
float64[] origin_x
float64[] origin_y
float64[] origin_z
uint32[] yaw_deg
float32[] support_ratio
# 1 = observed occupied support, 2 = floor prior only (never conflated).
uint8[] support_kind
int32[] verify_begin
int32[] verify_end
uint64 grid_total
uint64 feasible_total
uint64 rejected_out_of_domain
uint64 rejected_collision
uint64 rejected_clearance
uint64 rejected_unknown
uint64 rejected_support
# Frozen policy echo; the judge verifies these exact contract values.
float64 support_tol_m
float64 min_support_ratio
float64 clearance_margin_m
float64 same_layer_clearance_m
float64 resolution
int32[3] region_begin
int32[3] region_end
float64 repository_wait_ms
float64 enumerate_ms
float64 response_fill_ms
float64 server_total_ms

uld_occ_observer/ValidityStamp validity
